      "name": "confirmation-waiver",
      "title": "A confirmation can be waived — by the person who is owed it",
      "description": "A human may waive a confirmation they are owed — for a session, for a process run, or until a stated time. Covers what a waiver is made of, where it is recorded (the context graph, never the work plan), the gates that can be waived and the rules that cannot, why every waiver carries an expiry, and the one thing an agent may never do: grant itself one.",
